Package: pelandukos-iso-builder
Version: 0.2.4
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Tunnelbiz Studio Sdn Bhd <support@pelandukos.local>
Depends: libglib2.0-bin, dconf-cli, python3 (>= 3.11), xorriso (>= 1.5.4), squashfs-tools (>= 1:4.5), bubblewrap (>= 0.8.0-2+deb12u1), e2fsprogs, initramfs-tools-core, python3-pil, pkexec, polkitd
Recommends: qemu-system-x86, ovmf, busybox-static, kmod, file, zstd, python3-pyside6.qtwidgets, python3-pyside6.qtnetwork
Suggests: python3-venv
Description: Graphical builder for supported Debian Live ISO images
 Imports, edits and rebuilds a guarded single-SquashFS Debian Live layout.
 Includes PelandukOS minimal GNOME and repository app presets,
 legacy duplicate GRUB menu cleanup, a separate Polkit helper,
 private metadata-preserving storage,
 checksum and readback validation, and an embedded QEMU boot preview.
 This is an experimental Phase 1 release; real desktop ISO qualification
 is required before production use. Debian 12 requires a user PySide6 venv.
